WEBVTT

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:21.230
W-Wait! I did as you said...

00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:24.270
...and killed the criminal
who went after Whiteley...!

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:26.060
S-Spare me--

00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:33.700
Good. Mr Milverton instructed us

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:37.820
to make sure that this officer's
body would be found.

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:40.120
Go dump him somewhere suitable.

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:42.790
Then our next target...

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:50.670
...is Sam Whiteley--
the MP's brother.

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:14.070
<i>Tripped up by your twisted words</i>

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:17.820
<i>I can't fall asleep at night</i>

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:21.950
<i>Transfixed by your gaze</i>

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>I feel your sickness inside</i>

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:29.420
<i>Injured, I break down</i>

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:32.800
<i>this never-ending punishment</i>

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:37.180
<i>I feel your sins all the time</i>

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:41.760
<i>It's inescapable, take me away</i>

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:45.350
<i>I don't feel your love</i>
<i>But I can give you love</i>

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:49.480
<i>Show me a dream that will stir me awake</i>

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:53.110
<i>I don't feel your love</i>
<i>But I can give you love</i>

00:01:53.110 --> 00:01:57.240
<i>Whenever I awaken, you fall apart</i>

00:01:57.240 --> 00:02:00.320
<i>Someday... (Free your soul)</i>

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:04.660
<i>Find me (Free your mind)</i>

00:02:04.660 --> 00:02:08.120
<i>Steal your heart (Free your soul)</i>

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:12.000
<i>Endlessly (Free your mind)</i>

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:14.800
<i>I will scream aloud</i>

00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:27.730
"The White Knight of London Act 2"

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:37.360
Adam... you have that disagreeable
expression on your face.

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:39.780
Do you have something on your mind again?

00:02:39.780 --> 00:02:42.410
Yes, somewhat.

00:02:42.410 --> 00:02:47.250
But don't worry, Sam.
Things are taking a turn for the better.

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:49.040
Right.

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:53.500
Sir, Chief Inspector Paterson
is here to see you.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.800
All right, I'll be right in.

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:02.800
If I... could just have you
with me at my side...

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:05.600
...that's more than enough for me.

00:03:07.850 --> 00:03:11.810
Just a few hours ago, a police
officer called Bart Fowler

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:15.980
was found murdered in
one of the city's slums.

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:21.910
Officer Fowler was a guard in the Yard's
main office's detention block.

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:26.870
He was also on duty the night that
your bomber was killed in his cell.

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:32.620
According to our investigation,
Officer Fowler has a gravely ill mother,

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:36.800
and required a great deal
of money for her care.

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:41.720
But then, the day before last, he settled
with the hospital in one lump sum.

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:46.510
So they got to him by exploiting
the vulnerability of his mother.

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:50.310
Fowler silenced the bomber,
who had been hired for the money,

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:53.060
and then was silenced himself.

00:03:54.650 --> 00:04:00.360
The way Officer Fowler was extorted
and killed is unlike previous cases.

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:04.160
This was clearly the work
of a professional criminal.

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:09.830
Mr Whiteley, please take care to be even
more wary than you previously were.

00:04:09.830 --> 00:04:11.370
Understood.

00:04:21.550 --> 00:04:27.510
Marcus, cancel my entire morning schedule.
I have somewhere I need to go alone.

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:28.640
Huh?

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:31.640
Inspector Robinson, Inspector Sturridge,

00:04:31.640 --> 00:04:35.020
I want you to remain at the residence
and keep everyone here safe.

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:38.230
But, Mr Whiteley, things are
especially dangerous right now!

00:04:38.230 --> 00:04:40.650
The chief inspector just
got finished saying so!

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:42.360
He's right, sir!

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:44.780
Do not worry. I will be back shortly.

00:04:44.780 --> 00:04:46.320
Sir!

00:04:57.330 --> 00:05:02.010
This is awfully bold of him,
to go to negotiate on his own.

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:25.200
Welcome. I am Charles Augustus Milverton.

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:30.410
I am here because the House of Lords
requested that I represent them.

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:32.950
Do you take any exception to this?

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:36.370
Milverton? What is he doing here?

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:38.750
I have to let Will know about this!

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:42.630
No. I have no doubt that
a figure of your stature

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:46.180
would represent the House of Lords.

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:49.970
Very good. Now then,
to the matter at hand...

00:05:56.020 --> 00:05:58.400
Indeed.

00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:01.230
And what do you intend to do with this?

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:04.070
My demands are simple.

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:08.110
The first concerns the election
reform bill that I am pushing

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:10.160
through the House of Commons.

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:13.660
If it is voted down in the House of Lords,
I will go public with this.

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:14.950
What else?

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:16.960
My second demand...

00:06:16.960 --> 00:06:21.590
...is that no harm comes to myself,
nor to my dear family and friends...

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:24.300
...or I will go public with this.

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:30.550
If these two conditions are met,
then I will hold my tongue.

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:45.190
Very well. I will relay your demands
to my client to the letter.

00:06:51.320 --> 00:06:54.160
The best defence is a good offence.

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:58.460
Now I will be able to carve out
a path toward an ideal society.

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:07.170
How farcical. Imagine, me, the king
of blackmailers, being blackmailed.

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:09.590
But unfortunately for him...

00:07:09.590 --> 00:07:12.720
...I do not respond to blackmail.

00:07:23.560 --> 00:07:26.610
Someone broke in? No, it couldn't be!

00:07:32.280 --> 00:07:35.030
Sorry to barge in when
you're in such a rush,

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:40.120
but if you move in now, it would ruin
the show we have planned.

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:42.080
Which is why...

00:07:43.210 --> 00:07:46.590
...you get to stay here
and play with us, Fred.

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:50.220
Maggie!

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:53.510
Maggie? I need you to come over here.

00:07:58.430 --> 00:08:00.770
Is something wrong?

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:02.190
Maggie?

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:09.230
M-Maggie!

00:08:09.230 --> 00:08:11.360
O-Oh, no...!

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:18.540
Thank goodness! Get a doctor!
Maggie's been--!

00:08:30.880 --> 00:08:33.720
Maggie! I'm home!

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:35.010
Maggie?

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:40.430
Marcus!

00:08:40.430 --> 00:08:43.690
Marcus! What happened?! Snap to!

00:08:47.980 --> 00:08:50.570
I-It can't be...

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:55.240
S-Sam! Maggie! Anyone, answer me!

00:08:57.200 --> 00:08:59.790
M-Maggie...

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:18.050
Sam...

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:29.940
Oh, Sam... I can't bear a world
without you in it...

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:32.820
What am I supposed to do now...?

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:35.950
Who's there?!

00:09:37.820 --> 00:09:39.950
Sturridge?

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:44.200
What happened here?! Why are you
the only one who wasn't killed?

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:48.040
Don't tell me...

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:54.840
Why do devils tempt men and try to get
them to sully their hands with evil?

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:56.800
The answer is simple.

00:09:56.800 --> 00:10:02.600
To them, compelling those
who do good deeds to work evil

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:05.520
is what gives them
their greatest pleasure.

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:06.940
Since the dawn of history,

00:10:06.940 --> 00:10:11.230
nothing in the world has held greater
allure for mankind than wrongdoing.

00:10:11.230 --> 00:10:17.320
Consequently, it is depicted in the Bible
as being a forbidden delight.

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:22.660
And it is the pursuit thereof which
is the true essence of evil.

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:28.460
Evil is the transcendence of the rigours
and morals established by man.

00:10:28.460 --> 00:10:30.710
The evil wrought by the Lord of Crime

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:34.670
is merely the transgression of the social
conventions of human society.

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:41.090
But as for me? I am "evil" itself.

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:49.390
Did you do this?

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:53.570
Yes. I did it.

00:10:53.570 --> 00:10:57.110
I killed all of them.

00:10:57.110 --> 00:11:01.320
You're telling me you killed my family?!

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:02.660
Why?!

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:05.910
Sam couldn't have gotten away from you!

00:11:05.910 --> 00:11:11.000
Why would you kill my brother?!

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:16.380
Are you now trying to confess your sins,
begging me for forgiveness?!

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:19.970
I do not expect you to forgive me.

00:11:19.970 --> 00:11:27.270
However, please believe me. By no means
did I do this because I wanted to.

00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:29.390
Don't you lie to me, Sturridge!

00:11:29.390 --> 00:11:31.690
It is no lie!

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:34.770
I was forced to do this under duress!

00:11:34.770 --> 00:11:37.650
Duress?

00:11:37.650 --> 00:11:42.780
Someone abducted my wife
and child and issued a threat.

00:11:42.780 --> 00:11:48.790
It said, "Kill every member of Whiteley's
family, then make a confession to him.

00:11:48.790 --> 00:11:53.130
Do so, and I will return
your wife and child."

00:11:55.290 --> 00:12:00.590
I don't care what happens to me,
so long as my wife and child are safe.

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:05.640
I killed them with this knife.

00:12:05.640 --> 00:12:08.930
Please, deliver justice.

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:25.450
This is the man who killed Sam...
and Maggie... and Marcus...

00:12:38.170 --> 00:12:42.760
Sam... without you in my life,

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:45.140
there is no meaning for me
to change the world,

00:12:45.140 --> 00:12:48.010
nor any reason for me to live in it.

00:13:02.530 --> 00:13:06.450
Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:11.160
I just... I just can't bring
myself... to kill him...

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:41.980
Do you not find this to be
the greatest delight?

00:13:41.980 --> 00:13:46.780
Whiteley, popularly acclaimed as being
such an upstanding politician,

00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:50.490
has just stained his hands
in darkest black indeed.

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:53.000
Yes...

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:56.790
...at my behest.

00:13:58.460 --> 00:14:02.340
And now, a new villain is born.

00:14:08.050 --> 00:14:11.640
You're doing quite well
against the two of us, Fred.

00:14:11.640 --> 00:14:14.390
I'm becoming quite caught up in this.

00:14:14.390 --> 00:14:18.730
I would like you to entertain us further,
but we are quite busy, you understand.

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:22.730
It is high time... we ended this.

00:14:27.530 --> 00:14:28.570
Louis!

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:30.950
Are you all right, Fred?!

00:14:36.410 --> 00:14:38.670
I have a message from my boss for you.

00:14:38.670 --> 00:14:42.210
"Let's have a chat about
the future sometime,

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:45.670
whist gazing out over a view of the sea."

00:14:45.670 --> 00:14:50.220
We'll pick this up again then.
See you later, Louis and Fred.

00:15:15.660 --> 00:15:17.700
Mr Whiteley...

00:15:19.670 --> 00:15:22.000
Lord Moriarty...

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:26.840
Forgive me for calling you
out here at this hour.

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:31.050
I thought it best that I
return this evidence...

00:15:31.050 --> 00:15:34.300
...of the House of Lords'
corruption to you personally.

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:39.310
And why is that?

00:15:39.310 --> 00:15:42.480
I'd like you to keep your composure
when I tell you this,

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:48.070
but earlier tonight, I killed
a man with my own hands.

00:15:48.070 --> 00:15:51.910
My family was killed by the officer
I trusted as my bodyguard,

00:15:51.910 --> 00:15:56.120
and I... and I killed him.

00:15:57.040 --> 00:16:02.000
Reasons notwithstanding,
the fact that I killed a man--

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:08.090
and a police officer, at that--
will be fair game for my political rivals.

00:16:08.090 --> 00:16:12.970
Never mind passing my bill, the pathway
to bringing equality to this nation

00:16:12.970 --> 00:16:16.180
will now be completely cut off.

00:16:16.180 --> 00:16:21.310
If only I could atone for
this with my own life...

00:16:23.150 --> 00:16:24.860
Indeed.

00:16:25.810 --> 00:16:27.570
Who are you?

00:16:27.570 --> 00:16:31.530
I am Albert's younger brother, William.

00:16:31.530 --> 00:16:35.530
Younger brother? You have a brother, too?

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:39.080
I thank you for telling this to us,
when you are in such grief.

00:16:39.080 --> 00:16:42.830
You have been set up
by someone, Mr Whiteley.

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:47.210
This person is attempting to thwart the
realisation of equality in this country

00:16:47.210 --> 00:16:51.220
by driving you to commit murder.

00:16:51.220 --> 00:16:55.220
In other words, you have been exploited.

00:16:57.050 --> 00:16:59.140
That's one way of putting it.

00:16:59.140 --> 00:17:03.730
But the choice to lower myself to
committing murder was my own.

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:07.060
It's all over for me now.

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:09.690
It is not over just yet.

00:17:11.150 --> 00:17:17.620
If you truly intend to atone for
your crime with your death...

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:24.000
...then I would like to request your life.

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:41.350
It looks like rain. And it's time for
both Houses to convene already.

00:17:41.350 --> 00:17:43.980
I wonder if Whiteley
is really coming after all.

00:17:43.980 --> 00:17:47.600
His relations and the policemen
guarding them were killed, right?

00:17:47.600 --> 00:17:51.360
Yeah. And what's worse,
the culprit is still at large.

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:53.190
Oh, he's here!

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:57.570
Please keep back! Stay out of harm's way.

00:17:57.570 --> 00:17:58.990
You there, keep back!

00:17:58.990 --> 00:18:01.290
Sir! Mr Whiteley!

00:18:01.290 --> 00:18:03.830
Can I ask you what you
are feeling right now?

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:05.830
Mr Whiteley!

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:10.920
I have... had my precious family...

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:16.220
...as well as the officers who
were protecting me, killed...

00:18:16.220 --> 00:18:20.220
However, I will by no means
take a step back.

00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:24.470
Even if greater adversities
than this lie ahead,

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:29.730
I will continue fighting to correct
the inequality in this nation!

00:18:29.730 --> 00:18:31.980
That is who I am!

00:18:31.980 --> 00:18:34.360
--Whiteley!
--Whiteley!

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:44.580
Whiteley! Whiteley! Whiteley!

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:48.330
Whiteley! Whiteley...!

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:52.500
Whiteley is indeed this
country's white knight!

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:14.900
He's been stabbed!

00:19:20.740 --> 00:19:23.200
Who the devil is that?!

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:29.080
I am the one who killed the MP's family,
as well as the policemen.

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:33.130
This entire sequence of events
was planned out by me--

00:19:33.130 --> 00:19:35.500
the Lord of Crime!

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:37.670
Th-The Lord of Crime?!

00:19:37.670 --> 00:19:38.880
That's him?!

00:19:38.880 --> 00:19:41.470
So he really does exist!

00:19:41.470 --> 00:19:47.220
I am the one who will plunge London
into the depths of Hell.

00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:53.110
Now... go ahead and catch me, if you can!

00:19:54.980 --> 00:19:58.440
Seize him! We have him red-handed!
Do not let him escape!

00:19:58.440 --> 00:19:59.360
Sir!

00:19:59.360 --> 00:20:01.450
After the Lord of Crime!

00:20:01.450 --> 00:20:03.950
Sir! Mr Whiteley!

00:20:03.950 --> 00:20:07.410
Call a doctor! Call a doctor, now!

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:13.000
Give my life... to you?

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:19.340
This country, weltering in inequality,
still needs a hope for equality.

00:20:19.340 --> 00:20:24.390
If your crime ever comes to light,
then that hope will turn to despair,

00:20:24.390 --> 00:20:27.010
and the pathway to equality
will fall to pieces.

00:20:27.010 --> 00:20:32.270
But even if I die,
it won't blot out my crime.

00:20:32.270 --> 00:20:36.820
We will take the weight of the crime
you committed upon ourselves.

00:20:36.820 --> 00:20:38.530
You'll do what?!

00:20:38.530 --> 00:20:42.700
You will die playing the part
of this country's saviour.

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:46.870
I would like you to consider that
to be your final penance.

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:51.460
But why? Why on earth would you willingly
take the blame for my crime

00:20:51.460 --> 00:20:54.250
and volunteer to play the villain?

00:20:55.290 --> 00:20:57.130
Because...

00:20:58.210 --> 00:21:02.050
...we are the Lord of Crime.

00:21:04.470 --> 00:21:06.300
There he is! This way!

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:08.350
Head him off!

00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:10.720
After him! Do not let the
Lord of Crime get away!

00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:12.770
Post a cordon around the area!

00:21:15.190 --> 00:21:17.020
Please stay with us, sir!

00:21:17.020 --> 00:21:18.400
Sir!

00:21:19.570 --> 00:21:21.820
Moriarty...

00:21:23.570 --> 00:21:27.450
You readily choose to be
the necessary evil...

00:21:27.450 --> 00:21:32.120
...that this country,
weltering in inequality, needs.

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:37.750
I am sure that you brothers will
be able to change this country.

00:21:39.800 --> 00:21:41.630
Brother...

00:21:48.850 --> 00:21:53.640
I leave the country to you, Lord of Crime.

00:21:56.480 --> 00:22:02.230
Which will come out on top,
necessary evil, or pure evil?

00:22:02.230 --> 00:22:06.990
I will battle it out with you, Milverton.

00:22:07.410 --> 00:22:14.710
<i>Fate that over time changes</i>
<i>into chains of sorrow,</i>

00:22:14.710 --> 00:22:22.920
<i>leave me the light of rebirth</i>
<i>for the world ahead</i>

00:22:29.550 --> 00:22:33.520
<i>Struck by a frustration</i>
<i>I'd never experienced before,</i>

00:22:33.520 --> 00:22:36.890
<i>I feel lost, I feel lost</i>

00:22:36.890 --> 00:22:40.900
<i>The letters I dashed off</i>
<i>are all I remember</i>

00:22:40.900 --> 00:22:44.280
<i>It's all true, it's all true</i>

00:22:44.280 --> 00:22:51.700
<i>Witness as I forgo my forsaken future</i>
<i>with no regrets</i>

00:22:51.700 --> 00:23:00.290
<i>and you will win your intent</i>
<i>at the expense of becoming my pawn</i>

00:23:02.290 --> 00:23:08.090
<i>A scarlet thread fluttering in the wind</i>
<i>at five in the morning</i>

00:23:08.090 --> 00:23:14.350
<i>I'll recover my memories on the last day</i>

00:23:14.350 --> 00:23:17.140
<i>Hold me down till the end</i>

00:23:17.140 --> 00:23:22.810
<i>Finish by wiping away my sins,</i>

00:23:22.810 --> 00:23:29.490
